    "Name": "Raven",
    "Details": "The RVN-3A switch to use double heat sinks and an XL engine to enable the addition of two extra SRM launchers, one of them a Streak. The design also improves the electronic warfare capabilities of the 'Mech.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Jammer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
